["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1357: Furin, Naturally with Paul Bieinasz furin cleavage site NSP15 RXXR sarbecovirus OC43\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-twiv-造一个-furin-位点根本不难-难的是承认它不罕见/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">1:44:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>造一个 furin 位点根本不难，难的是承认它不罕见</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">深度测序显示，冠状病毒基因组里每千个就有几个带插入，furin 位点在同一位置至少被独立撞上三次——实验室起源论的概率论证站不住脚。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">病毒学</span><span class=\"tag\">深度测序</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The First Punic War corvus Mamertines Mix-Hellenes Monte Fortino\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-ancients-罗马的胜利靠一只乌鸦-第一次布匿战争的关键/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2e86106fe99ba32a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>罗马的胜利靠一只乌鸦：第一次布匿战争的关键</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">罗马靠一种叫 corvus 的登船吊桥把海战变成陆战，抵消了迦太基的水手优势；但迦太基请来一位斯巴达人重整军队，反手俘虏了罗马执政官。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古代史</span><span class=\"tag\">罗马</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"363: Why Vegetables Are Good for Your Heart settle plate DNIC EPR sGC mTORC1\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-thisweekinmicr-本生灯不减少平板污染-蔬菜护心另有机制/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/edf553b27ee2c1ff-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Microbiology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>本生灯不减少平板污染，蔬菜护心另有机制</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">本生灯在低污染环境下反而可能增加沉降菌落；蔬菜护心可能不是硝酸盐-亚硝酸盐-NO 通路，而是肠道菌把硝酸盐和铁做成 DNIC 直接激活 sGC。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">微生物学</span><span class=\"tag\">无菌操作</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"We Asked Fidelity&#x27;s Ex-President What Made Peter Lynch Great — and Where Private Credit Risk Hides private credit affiliated investments rating shopping auto-IRA reversion to the mean\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-excessreturns-私募信贷的风险藏在保险公司的评级里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cac5e72b6049e76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Excess Returns</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>私募信贷的风险藏在保险公司的评级里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">私募信贷大量进入保险公司，且多为关联方投资，评级由私营机构给出、系统性偏高；若按正确评级，保险公司每年要多留 4000-5000 亿美元资本。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">私募信贷</span><span class=\"tag\">保险公司</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The History of Perfume: Mankind&#x27;s Millennia Long Battle Against Stank miasma theory ambergris nosegay fixative\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-extracredits-人类几千年对抗恶臭-香水最初是烧给神的烟/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8ffaf32042b4c196-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">16:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ExtraCredits</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>人类几千年对抗恶臭，香水最初是烧给神的烟</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">香水不是从奢侈享受开始的，而是从宗教焚香和防病开始的——欧洲人相信难闻的空气会传播疾病，于是用香味把自己围起来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">香水史</span><span class=\"tag\">宗教仪式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM Highlights: Astra as AGI, OpenAI&#x27;s Pause, Mythos @ Mozilla &amp; Human Agency vs Technocapitalism agent workday METR paper clipper safe harbor Dyson sphere\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-cogrev-astra-跨过-agi-门槛-但没人能审计它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/36e51d00f0d50003-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:42:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>Astra 跨过 AGI 门槛，但没人能审计它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Astra 让人类再也不用做某些任务，OpenAI 却只暂停了一半 RL 算力；外部审计被卡死在发布前两三天，房间里没有大人可以接锅。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">Astra</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Open Models Change The Economics of AI harness open weights router MLX DGX Spark\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-ycsp-企业最终八成-token-走开源模型-但只花两成预算/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f442bffca180d6cf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">57:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>企业最终八成 token 走开源模型，但只花两成预算</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">开源模型和闭源前沿模型不是替代关系：绝大多数 token 会走开源，最难的活留给前沿实验室，中间靠路由和编排把两者接起来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">推理成本</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Flexner Report Flexner Report AAMC The Usefulness of Useless Knowledge\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-stuffmissed-一份报告关掉上百所医学院-黑人医生从此断层/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>一份报告关掉上百所医学院，黑人医生从此断层</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Flexner Report 常被写成医学教育现代化的起点，但它同时让七所黑人医学院关掉五所，此后近四十年没有新的黑人医学院出现。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医学教育</span><span class=\"tag\">种族不平等</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Skeptics Guide #1105 - Sep 12 2026 physical reservoir computing island of stability coronagraph contingent learning big rip\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-skeptics-改一条物理定律-每个愿望都会反噬/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc4dc31b3b84e70d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:23:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Skeptics Guide</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>改一条物理定律，每个愿望都会反噬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dragon Con 现场的思想实验：只能改一条物理定律让科幻成真，结果每个愿望都被拆出没算进去的后果——反重力等于免费能源，超空间旅行等于把技术送给所有外星文明。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">物理定律</span><span class=\"tag\">太空望远镜</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Judith Dada on the Rise of the AfD model routing Pareto-frontier model Migrationshintergrund Aktienrente tech-brosphere\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-goodfight-德国车败给中国电动车-afd-崛起只是症状/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>德国车败给中国电动车，AfD 崛起只是症状</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AfD 不是德国问题而是西方问题：人们觉得明天不会更好，而德国引以为傲的汽车、化工、铁路同时失去竞争力，才是极右翼真正的燃料。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">欧洲科技</span><span class=\"tag\">AfD</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Companies Are Becoming a Series of Loops | Anish Acharya on Lenny’s Podcast autocatalytic effects RSI out of distribution thinking cornered resource revealed preferences stated preferences\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-a16z-公司正在变成一串嵌套的-loop-但-loop-只能爬到局部最优/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>公司正在变成一串嵌套的 loop，但 loop 只能爬到局部最优</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">prompt 之后是 agent，agent 之后是 loop。loop 会帮你爬到局部最大值然后平台化，这时需要人的直觉帮你落到下一座山的山脚。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>19</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">agent</span><span class=\"tag\">loop</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Robert Friedland on the World&#x27;s Monumental Shortage of Copper NPV model heap leach tailings dam solid oxide fuel cell\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-oddlots-铜矿品位从2-跌到0-4-ai的电力需求却要上天/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>铜矿品位从2%跌到0.4%，AI的电力需求却要上天</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">全球铜矿品位持续下滑、新矿审批要35年，而AI搜索耗电是普通搜索的30倍——供给在萎缩，需求在爆炸，铜正在变成新的石油。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">铜</span><span class=\"tag\">大宗商品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"20VC: 7 Predictions for How AI Changes the World: Labour, Engineering, Social Media, GrokBots Buying Cybercabs and more with Matteo Franceschetti, Co-Founder @ Eight Sleep BOM COGS CAC incrementality test\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-twentyvc-工程师一年前就不写代码了-ai-员工让公司规模翻三倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/78efdf2666aab65e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">20VC</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>工程师一年前就不写代码了，AI 员工让公司规模翻三倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Eight Sleep 的邮件营销团队从 2 人变 0 人，年收入接近 1 亿美元；工程师一年前停止写代码，用几百个 AI 工程师替代。Matteo 开始统计「人类员工」和「AI 员工」，把 AI 算进来公司规模是现在的三到四倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 员工</span><span class=\"tag\">硬件创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1356: Clinical update with Dr. Daniel Griffin MACE Bundibugyo virus immune amnesia target trial emulation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-twiv-美国麻疹卷土重来-cdc-拒绝承认两例儿童死亡/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">47:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>美国麻疹卷土重来：CDC 拒绝承认两例儿童死亡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">宾州两例麻疹死亡被 CDC 从周报里抹掉，理由是「信息不足」——但 CDC 自己就参与了那场调查。先例比个案更危险：州上报的法定传染病数据，从此可以被联邦以未公开标准驳回。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共卫生</span><span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1356: Clinical update with Dr. Daniel Griffin MACE Bundibugyo virus notifiable disease report target trial emulation immune amnesia\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-twiv-美国麻疹死婴被从cdc数据里抹掉-州报告权正在被联邦接管/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">47:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>美国麻疹死婴被从CDC数据里抹掉，州报告权正在被联邦接管</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">CDC 拒绝把宾州两例麻疹死亡计入全国统计，理由是「信息不足」——但 CDC 自己就参与了那次调查。先例比个案更危险：州报告变成可谈判的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共卫生</span><span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI Kills Everybody or Doomer Psyop? OpenAI&#x27;s Math Breakthrough, Nike&#x27;s $200B Collapse Doomer RSI ZDR S-1 DTC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-allin-ai-末日论是场心理战-靶子是开源/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2e7d0b1750f8c272-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:35:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>AI 末日论是场心理战，靶子是开源</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic 一边请公开市场以万亿估值承保自己，一边由安全负责人背书「AI 可能终结文明」——这不是内部矛盾，是一场以开源为最终靶子的监管铺垫。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 监管</span><span class=\"tag\">开源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Finding Stability in Investing: Masters in Business with Seth Bernstein ad valorem pricing K-1 glide path SMA superannuation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-mastersinbiz-主动管理巨头把总部搬去纳什维尔-一年省下8500万美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">59:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>主动管理巨头把总部搬去纳什维尔，一年省下8500万美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Alliance Bernstein 从纽约迁往纳什维尔，每年省下约8500万美元，且不强迫任何基金经理搬家——省的是地产和人员成本，赌的是能招到纽约招不到的人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">资产管理</span><span class=\"tag\">私募信贷</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Fruitfly Hard Takeoff, Washington on AI Risk, 𝕏 Timeline Reactions | Thijs Simonian, Alex Heath &amp; Guy Oseary, Mitesh Agrawal AI 2040 SO-100 commodity memory CoWoS gigawatt plus\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-tbpn-ai-2040-不是停掉-ai-是把超级智能推迟到-2040/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d5c9897d5e90ae69-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:45:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TBPN</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>AI 2040 不是停掉 AI，是把超级智能推迟到 2040</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">反 AI 提案的真实机制是算力上限：暂停新前沿训练，只允许推理，用 1 MB/s 的对外连接和法拉第笼把偷权重变成不可能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 监管</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Chansons de Geste and 12th Century Performance Sample Chanson de Geste laisse decasyllabic meter oliphant jongleur Anglo-Norman\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-britishhist-最古老的-罗兰之歌-抄本-其实是个英国人的演出本/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">19:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>最古老的《罗兰之歌》抄本，其实是个英国人的演出本</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">牛津 Digby 23 抄本用盎格鲁-诺曼方言写成，学者靠方言漂移把它定在 1140 到 1170 年之间——这首法国史诗最完整的版本，是演给英国人听的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世纪</span><span class=\"tag\">手稿</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: 9.11, Death of the Army, So Long Dan Driscoll op-tempo MRAP ATGM Ranger tab OODA loop distillation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-chinatalk-陆军部长辞职-最会打仗的人先被清掉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ccd87d69de9eb025-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>陆军部长辞职：最会打仗的人先被清掉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">9·11 后 25 年，美军一直在跑步机上：预算被战争吃掉，转型只能靠便宜技术硬上，而真正懂技术、敢冒险的军官正被一批批清出去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">国防</span><span class=\"tag\">美军转型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI researchers debate how close we are to recursive self-improvement RSI sim-to-real gap mid-training entropy collapse logit distillation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-dwarkesh-ai-研究员两年提速-10-倍-但-rsi-可能比当律师助理更容易/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6bcdcaa041341c8a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>AI 研究员两年提速 10 倍，但 RSI 可能比当律师助理更容易</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">RSI 是累积型任务，理论上一个不到百万 token 的 Python 文件就能从零训出可递归自我改进的模型；而律所法务助理要记住不断变化的人际关系和隐性做事方式，是非平稳分布。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">RSI</span><span class=\"tag\">持续学习</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"What&#x27;s the Concern? DAT (Digital Asset Treasury) liability management exercise Cede &amp; Co DTC (Depository Trust Company) delta neutral\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-moneystuff-快船用假代言绕工资帽-nba-请律所查出了更多/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">40:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>快船用假代言绕工资帽，NBA 请律所查出了更多</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Wachtell 的独立调查报告没有给快船洗白，反而把丑闻做大：除了 Aspiration，还有一串由快船出资、最终流向 Kawhi Leonard 的假代言。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">私募股权</span><span class=\"tag\">加密资产</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"No.233 单口｜手机为什么要折叠？Apple 为什么要「跟风」？ all in one LUI GUI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-cn1b5ef7-折叠屏不是手机的未来-是给一部分人的二合一/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/16901c42a6295443-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"三\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">三五环</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>折叠屏不是手机的未来，是给一部分人的二合一</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">折叠屏卖到千万台，但内屏打开率不足三成。它不会替代直板机，只对「手机加 iPad 二合一」的人是加分项，对其他人是牺牲握持和性能的减分项。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">折叠屏</span><span class=\"tag\">苹果</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Why’s everybody going to Japan? soft power shokunin Japanism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-searchengine-美国人突然爱上日本-不是因为便宜-是因为它太正常了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/09ff12606d9630c4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">50:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Search Engine</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>美国人突然爱上日本，不是因为便宜，是因为它太正常了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">日本旅游爆发的真正推手不是汇率，是公共空间的功能性——地铁干净、准时、没有垃圾。美国游客在东京体验到的，是一个熵被暂停的社会。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">日本旅游</span><span class=\"tag\">软实力</span>\n</div></div></a>"]